change user password on NixOS systems that use `hashedPasswordFile`

USAGE: hpf-passwd [OPTIONS] [LOGIN]

ARGS:
  [LOGIN]  User to change the password of [env: $SUDO_USER, $USER]

OPTIONS:
      --dry-run                                                    Show what would be done without changing any files
  -p, --fix-permissions                                            Set permissions for hashed password file without changing the file contents
  -F, --flake <FLAKE-URI>                                          Flake URI to pass to nixos-option(8)
  -I, --include <PATH>                                             Add path to Nix expression search path to pass to nixos-option(8)
  -P, --prefix <PREFIX-DIR>                                        Prefix to add to `hashedPasswordFile` path
      --extra-experimental-features <EXTRA-EXPERIMENTAL-FEATURES>  Additional experimental features to pass to nixos-options(8)
  -h, --help                                                       Print help
  -V, --version                                                    Print version
